                                        "entry_id": "0034aa4b-c6c3-31a0-8ca2-82ec7771efe1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bird-like demon feeding on human flesh and blood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3fc74ac-cdcd-4045-9853-14281de99223",
                                                "sense_id": "ae2d7237-8c81-3ff1-8c62-62c67276a9c0",
                                                "text": "What was distinctive about the strix was that […] it resembled an owl, or (to a lesser extent) a bat, being a winged, clawed creature, which flew by night and had a hideous screeching cry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
